# Local / CI placeholders — do not put real secrets in git.
# Configure these Apps Script Script properties (Project Settings):
#   VERTEX_PROJECT_ID            (preferred production path; OAuth via ScriptApp.getOAuthToken)
#   VERTEX_LOCATION              (optional; default us-central1, or global)
#   VERTEX_MODEL                 (optional; default gemini-2.5-flash)
#   GEMINI_API_KEY               (used when VERTEX_PROJECT_ID is not set)
#   SCITE_API_KEY                (optional research)
#   BEAUTIFUL_AI_KEY             (optional; CONFIG.useBeautifulAi is false by default)
#   SHAPE_KIT_ID_V2              (created automatically)
# Do not commit real keys.
# GitHub Actions secrets for deploy.yml:
#   CLASPRC_JSON
#   SCRIPT_ID
#   DEPLOYMENT_ID
